# Static Information Dashboard Design: gt and gtExtras methods
## Plotting a simple bullet chart

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(gt)
library(gtExtras)   # for gt_plt_bullet and gt_theme_538
library(dplyr)

product %>%
  gt::gt() %>%
  gt_plt_bullet(column = current, 
              target = target, 
              width = 60,
              palette = c("lightblue", 
                          "black")) %>%
  gt_theme_538()
```

